WEBVTT

01:35.940 --> 01:40.830
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.539 --> 01:44.009
[Episode 14]

01:44.759 --> 01:45.840
Is she an enemy?

01:47.700 --> 01:48.880
She was.

01:49.229 --> 01:49.920
And now?

01:52.070 --> 01:54.470
Whoever she is now
is none of your business.

01:56.000 --> 01:56.789
Fine.

01:57.950 --> 01:59.590
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

01:58.289 --> 02:00.170
If your mother were still alive,

02:00.200 --> 02:02.150
seeing you so troubled by love,

02:04.040 --> 02:05.840
she would probably laugh at you.

02:05.910 --> 02:07.520
Troubled by love?

02:08.070 --> 02:09.820
Before I avenge my mother,

02:09.880 --> 02:11.810
[In Memory of Late Mother Qingyu]

02:10.360 --> 02:12.620
I have no time to think about such things.

02:12.640 --> 02:14.020
Why did you come to Yujing

02:14.020 --> 02:14.880
this time?

02:14.900 --> 02:16.160
How long will you stay?

02:16.400 --> 02:17.590
Is it for the wedding?

02:17.590 --> 02:18.310
I'm not interested

02:18.310 --> 02:19.380
in joining the fun.

02:19.710 --> 02:21.000
I'm here to see a patient.

02:21.000 --> 02:22.260
I'll leave after that.

02:23.010 --> 02:29.040
[Wutong Mansion]

02:23.520 --> 02:24.560
Make sure to send Lord Ling

02:24.560 --> 02:25.260
back to Zhengnian Hall.

02:25.260 --> 02:25.810
Yes.

02:26.079 --> 02:27.030
With me here,

02:27.240 --> 02:28.440
he's unlikely to die.

02:45.470 --> 02:46.329
Your Highness.

02:46.710 --> 02:48.640
Xia Jingshi took Xiao Weiran away?

02:49.329 --> 02:50.340
How did you know?

02:51.890 --> 02:56.810
[Wutong Mansion]

02:53.340 --> 02:55.079
I locked him up in the patrol unit

02:55.079 --> 02:57.360
precisely to make it easier
for them to rescue him.

02:57.360 --> 02:59.090
If I'd kept him in my residence,

02:59.240 --> 03:00.100
do you think Prime Minister Zhuang
and his people

03:00.100 --> 03:01.630
would've dared make a move?

03:01.910 --> 03:02.590
But Xia Jingshi

03:02.590 --> 03:03.740
didn't go to get him himself.

03:03.740 --> 03:05.400
He went through the envoys
of the two nations.

03:05.400 --> 03:06.240
At the Ministry of Rites,

03:06.240 --> 03:07.260
they promised Xia Jingshi

03:07.260 --> 03:09.060
that they would help him
bring Miss Yixiao back.

03:09.060 --> 03:10.720
Xia Jingshi probably thought

03:11.700 --> 03:12.900
it wouldn't work out,

03:13.190 --> 03:14.030
so he gave the opportunity

03:14.030 --> 03:15.030
to Xiao Weiran.

03:15.680 --> 03:16.700
Which means

03:17.200 --> 03:18.780
Xia Jingshi
has already tacitly acknowledged

03:18.780 --> 03:19.680
that Miss Yixiao

03:19.680 --> 03:20.880
isn't your prisoner,

03:21.310 --> 03:22.710
but stayed voluntarily.

03:22.720 --> 03:24.320
Xiao Weiran switched sides.

03:24.430 --> 03:26.300
He saw the play couldn't go on,

03:26.800 --> 03:28.260
so he just dropped the act.

03:29.000 --> 03:30.470
If you're right,

03:30.680 --> 03:31.430
Xiao Weiran

03:31.430 --> 03:33.290
probably won't return to Yujing.

03:33.550 --> 03:36.120
Xia Jingshi
will naturally reassign him elsewhere.

03:36.120 --> 03:37.400
If he stays in Susha,

03:37.590 --> 03:39.920
he would be under our close surveillance.

03:43.400 --> 03:44.130
Where is she?

03:44.910 --> 03:45.430
Lu Ke?

03:46.470 --> 03:47.150
Didn't you send him

03:47.150 --> 03:48.210
to chase Xun Xiang?

03:51.540 --> 03:52.940
Oh, you mean Miss Yixiao.

03:53.190 --> 03:54.920
She's still at Zhengnian Hall.

03:55.700 --> 03:57.240
I helped her save Ning Fei,

03:57.710 --> 03:58.430
and she thinks one thank‑you

03:58.430 --> 03:59.850
is enough to brush me off?

04:00.150 --> 04:00.710
Exactly.

04:01.150 --> 04:02.030
If it weren't for

04:02.030 --> 04:02.780
your sake,

04:03.240 --> 04:04.030
Lord Ling

04:04.080 --> 04:05.460
wouldn't care about that Ning Fei.

04:05.460 --> 04:06.680
Miss Yixiao should at least offer

04:06.680 --> 04:07.880
to treat you to a meal.

04:08.150 --> 04:08.960
So rude.

04:11.590 --> 04:14.030
Go tell the kitchen
to prepare some good dishes

04:14.030 --> 04:15.090
and a few jars of fine wine.

04:15.090 --> 04:15.890
Call her over.

04:18.680 --> 04:19.390
And invite Miss Ling

04:19.390 --> 04:20.550
and those kids too.

04:21.190 --> 04:22.050
Your Highness,

04:22.190 --> 04:23.160
you helped her,

04:23.190 --> 04:25.320
and now you're inviting her to dinner?

04:25.950 --> 04:27.900
Inviting her to dinner?

04:28.190 --> 04:29.420
Don't I need to eat?

04:29.440 --> 04:30.640
Don't you need to eat?

04:30.920 --> 04:32.920
I've already eaten, Your Highness.

04:40.430 --> 04:41.040
Yixiao?

04:41.780 --> 04:42.870
She's not here.

04:43.120 --> 04:44.090
She sent Ning Fei off

04:44.090 --> 04:45.490
and left just after dusk.

04:45.920 --> 04:46.890
Where did she go?

04:47.040 --> 04:48.330
She didn't say.

04:48.560 --> 04:49.190
I thought she went back

04:49.190 --> 04:51.050
to the First Prince's residence.

05:28.520 --> 05:30.030
I knew you'd come.

05:30.930 --> 05:32.260
With your personality,

05:32.920 --> 05:35.600
you'd have to get to the bottom of it
no matter what.

05:35.600 --> 05:37.659
Aren't you going to tell me the truth?

05:53.680 --> 05:54.600
On the cliff,

05:55.430 --> 05:56.600
were you that eager

05:56.620 --> 05:57.620
to see me dead?

06:01.190 --> 06:02.120
I never once thought of

06:02.120 --> 06:02.850
killing you.

06:04.760 --> 06:06.560
But since I was working with him,

06:06.750 --> 06:08.610
I couldn't let you stand in my way.

06:09.750 --> 06:10.480
Meng Junran,

06:10.750 --> 06:12.150
when will the military funds

06:12.150 --> 06:13.390
you promised arrive?

06:13.870 --> 06:15.560
Yesterday, 100,000 taels of silver

06:15.560 --> 06:16.720
were already sent off under the escort

06:16.720 --> 06:18.190
of the Rongtong Escort Agency.

06:18.190 --> 06:20.120
They'll soon reach Pingling City.

06:20.470 --> 06:22.330
I've fulfilled my promise to you.

06:23.040 --> 06:24.100
But what about you?

06:25.000 --> 06:26.680
Didn't you say that with our plan,

06:26.680 --> 06:29.340
we would definitely win
the Battle of Pingling?

06:29.510 --> 06:30.910
You don't need to tell me.

06:31.830 --> 06:32.920
I know it was
that female commander of yours

06:32.920 --> 06:35.120
who ruined our plan with a single arrow.

06:35.240 --> 06:36.500
Since that's the case,

06:37.000 --> 06:39.120
Prince of Zhennan,
why don't you execute her

06:39.120 --> 06:40.450
to uphold military law?

06:42.830 --> 06:43.510
What?

06:44.080 --> 06:45.340
You can't bear to do it?

06:45.560 --> 06:47.890
One must pay the price for their mistakes.

06:48.920 --> 06:50.120
How Yixiao should be punished

06:50.120 --> 06:52.220
is an internal matter
for the Zhennan Army.

06:52.220 --> 06:53.730
It's none of your concern.

06:58.560 --> 06:59.480
Who is that

07:00.920 --> 07:01.860
masked man?

07:02.390 --> 07:03.190
If you hadn't

07:03.190 --> 07:05.450
relentlessly tried to kill him that day,

07:06.430 --> 07:07.360
would we

07:07.360 --> 07:08.610
be in this mess today?

07:11.750 --> 07:12.320
Yixiao!

07:13.630 --> 07:14.270
Yixiao!

07:14.630 --> 07:15.140
Yixiao!

07:15.170 --> 07:15.700
Stop!

07:16.190 --> 07:16.880
Your Highness,

07:16.880 --> 07:18.000
don't try to stop me.

07:18.000 --> 07:19.600
That person from Susha
definitely has ill intentions.

07:19.600 --> 07:20.620
He'll pass here

07:20.650 --> 07:21.750
on his way back to Susha.

07:21.750 --> 07:22.430
Let me kill him.

07:22.430 --> 07:23.960
Yixiao. Yixiao, calm down!

07:25.600 --> 07:27.450
Your Highness,
you don't want me to kill him?

07:27.450 --> 07:29.180
Does that mean you want me dead?

07:29.920 --> 07:31.030
What are you talking about?

07:31.030 --> 07:32.360
You know I wouldn't kill you.

07:32.360 --> 07:33.670
Why are you forcing me?

07:33.700 --> 07:35.000
Don't be deceived by that person.

07:35.000 --> 07:35.909
We're running out of time.

07:35.909 --> 07:37.040
Just let me kill him.

07:37.040 --> 07:38.710
No one deceived me.

07:38.740 --> 07:40.300
This is all my own choice.

07:46.570 --> 07:47.500
Your own choice?

07:49.830 --> 07:50.470
Yixiao,

07:50.720 --> 07:51.580
it's all right.

07:51.920 --> 07:52.620
I know.

07:52.760 --> 07:54.190
I know that you don't understand me now.

07:54.190 --> 07:55.630
You will understand in the future.

07:55.630 --> 07:56.480
Everything I've done

07:56.480 --> 07:57.790
is for our future.

07:58.590 --> 07:59.730
Give me the bow now

07:59.750 --> 08:00.800
and come back with me.

08:00.800 --> 08:01.240
Okay?

08:05.340 --> 08:06.280
Give me the bow!

08:06.870 --> 08:08.200
Whatever your reasons,

08:08.630 --> 08:09.510
you cannot sacrifice

08:09.510 --> 08:10.680
the people of Zhennan Pass!

08:10.680 --> 08:12.340
War always costs lives!

08:12.620 --> 08:13.860
I'm ordering you now

08:14.020 --> 08:15.150
to come back with me!

08:15.190 --> 08:16.570
Soldiers spill blood

08:16.600 --> 08:17.950
and die on the battlefield

08:17.950 --> 08:18.680
so the common people

08:18.680 --> 08:19.800
can live in peace

08:19.800 --> 08:21.160
and avoid slaughter!

08:21.190 --> 08:22.780
But for your own selfish reasons,

08:22.780 --> 08:24.240
you want to sacrifice the lives

08:24.240 --> 08:25.770
of 300,000 civilians at Zhennan Pass!

08:25.770 --> 08:27.180
How could you be so cruel,

08:27.200 --> 08:28.900
so heartless?

08:30.510 --> 08:31.560
I am cruel?

08:32.270 --> 08:33.130
Let me tell you,

08:33.720 --> 08:35.360
if I had the slightest bit of

08:35.360 --> 08:36.400
soft-heartedness,

08:36.400 --> 08:37.120
I, Xia Jingshi,

08:37.120 --> 08:39.120
wouldn't have lived to see this day.

08:40.390 --> 08:41.030
Yixiao,

08:41.600 --> 08:42.530
I'm begging you.

08:43.280 --> 08:45.080
Just pretend nothing happened.

08:45.080 --> 08:46.440
Pretend you don't know anything.

08:46.440 --> 08:47.300
Go back with me!

08:47.320 --> 08:48.390
I won't go back!

08:49.030 --> 08:49.890
Your Highness,

08:51.030 --> 08:53.360
I'm sorry I cannot obey your orders today.

08:53.450 --> 08:54.910
If you insist on this path,

08:55.200 --> 08:57.400
I'll kill him even if it costs me my life!

09:00.670 --> 09:01.270
Yixiao,

09:02.240 --> 09:03.550
I knew this path

09:03.550 --> 09:05.080
would be full of obstacles,

09:06.440 --> 09:07.600
but I never imagined

09:07.630 --> 09:09.120
you'd become one of them.

09:10.320 --> 09:11.770
I also never imagined

09:13.510 --> 09:16.000
you could be so ruthless.

09:17.840 --> 09:18.360
Fine.

09:20.960 --> 09:22.240
So you really want to do this,

09:22.240 --> 09:22.870
right?

09:35.960 --> 09:37.380
Didn't you just say

09:38.080 --> 09:39.410
everything you had done

09:40.160 --> 09:41.720
is for our future?

09:42.860 --> 09:43.720
Then right now,

09:43.960 --> 09:45.870
I'll act on behalf of my future self

09:45.870 --> 09:46.600
and stop you.

09:48.600 --> 09:49.460
Will you let me?

09:52.600 --> 09:54.660
I have never begged you for anything.

09:56.360 --> 09:57.080
Today,

09:57.870 --> 09:59.630
I'm begging you.

10:33.120 --> 10:33.720
No.

10:33.720 --> 10:34.340
Yixiao!

10:49.270 --> 10:50.290
Put down the bow!

10:53.620 --> 10:54.660
Don't force me!

11:50.110 --> 11:52.520
♪ The rain drifts endlessly ♪

11:53.110 --> 11:55.990
♪ The old dream burns the heart ♪

11:56.500 --> 11:58.760
♪ Dreams sink into ruin ♪

11:59.460 --> 12:02.520
♪ Missing the warmth of your palm ♪

12:03.030 --> 12:05.270
♪ Awaiting dusk ♪

12:05.820 --> 12:09.050
♪ Shadows take root in the mountain pass ♪

12:09.610 --> 12:15.280
♪ In just a moment, tears stained ♪

12:15.940 --> 12:17.850
♪ Amid the bustling sound
of wind and rain ♪

12:18.330 --> 12:22.080
♪ Who laughs at me,
heart cold as the desert? ♪

12:22.400 --> 12:24.260
♪ Dreams turn through a lifetime ♪

12:24.540 --> 12:28.310
♪ Who sighs for me,
enduring separations? ♪

12:29.080 --> 12:30.760
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

12:31.580 --> 12:34.430
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

12:35.120 --> 12:40.110
♪ Clouds vanish, rain ceases, seek me ♪

12:44.270 --> 12:46.870
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

12:50.980 --> 12:53.360
♪ Time is unbearable to endure ♪

12:53.540 --> 12:55.000
At the Battle of Pingling,

12:55.630 --> 12:56.320
your plan

12:56.320 --> 12:57.720
was to use the lives
of hundreds of thousands

12:57.720 --> 12:58.870
of civilians in the city as bait,

12:58.870 --> 12:59.470
wasn't it?

13:00.320 --> 13:02.510
Once Feng Suige had breached Zhennan Pass,

13:02.510 --> 13:04.040
he would not only have died,

13:04.670 --> 13:06.220
but would also have been branded
with the stigma of a city massacre.

13:06.220 --> 13:07.560
Of course he must die.

13:08.270 --> 13:09.150
Only his death

13:09.150 --> 13:11.040
can throw Susha into utter chaos.

13:11.440 --> 13:12.270
Only with his death

13:12.270 --> 13:12.910
will I one day

13:12.910 --> 13:14.910
be free from fighting on two fronts.

13:14.910 --> 13:15.440
Yixiao,

13:16.320 --> 13:17.720
you must understand that

13:17.840 --> 13:19.240
he is our real enemy.

13:19.240 --> 13:20.000
Are the civilians in that city

13:20.000 --> 13:21.370
your enemies too?

13:25.960 --> 13:26.510
Yes.

13:27.630 --> 13:29.490
So many people can be sacrificed.

13:30.390 --> 13:31.480
I, Fu Yixiao,

13:33.080 --> 13:35.330
just a mere officer of the Zhennan Army—

13:36.360 --> 13:38.120
what does it matter if I die?

13:39.480 --> 13:40.840
I never intended

13:40.840 --> 13:41.520
to kill you.

13:41.630 --> 13:42.270
If that day

13:42.270 --> 13:43.910
I had truly wanted to kill you,

13:43.910 --> 13:45.120
how would that arrow have ended up

13:45.120 --> 13:46.120
in your shoulder?

13:46.960 --> 13:47.630
Well then,

13:47.630 --> 13:49.270
thank you for not killing me.

13:53.340 --> 13:54.310
Xia Jingshi,

13:55.280 --> 13:56.880
I'm asking you one last time—

13:57.440 --> 13:58.510
who is

13:58.510 --> 13:59.370
the masked man?

14:00.510 --> 14:01.030
Yixiao,

14:03.020 --> 14:03.550
can you

14:03.550 --> 14:04.550
come back to me?

14:05.120 --> 14:06.840
I'm asking who that person is!

14:06.840 --> 14:07.650
Answer me!

14:08.550 --> 14:10.550
I don't expect you to understand me.

14:10.770 --> 14:11.970
I only want to tell you

14:13.790 --> 14:14.750
that I used to think

14:14.750 --> 14:15.670
everything I wanted

14:15.670 --> 14:17.000
was the most important,

14:17.120 --> 14:18.920
but after losing you, I realized

14:21.150 --> 14:22.750
you were what mattered most.

14:23.480 --> 14:24.600
I never truly wanted

14:24.600 --> 14:25.440
to kill you.

14:28.080 --> 14:29.410
Give me another chance.

14:30.360 --> 14:31.890
You still refuse to tell me.

14:34.000 --> 14:34.510
I know.

14:35.600 --> 14:36.810
It was all my fault before.

14:36.810 --> 14:37.670
Whatever happened before,

14:37.670 --> 14:38.270
it was all my fault.

14:38.270 --> 14:39.320
I did everything wrong.

14:39.320 --> 14:40.270
I know that whatever I say now

14:40.270 --> 14:41.040
is useless.

14:41.300 --> 14:42.230
All I ask

14:42.630 --> 14:44.160
is for you to come back to me.

14:44.550 --> 14:46.050
As long as you come back to me,

14:46.050 --> 14:47.450
I'll do anything you ask.

14:47.750 --> 14:49.150
I can give up everything.

14:49.600 --> 14:51.210
We can be like before.

14:51.440 --> 14:52.550
Let's start over.

14:52.910 --> 14:53.870
Let's be together again,

14:53.870 --> 14:54.360
okay?

14:57.510 --> 14:59.320
You look ridiculous now.

15:00.870 --> 15:02.130
No matter what you say,

15:02.720 --> 15:03.980
there's no going back.

15:08.000 --> 15:09.630
When you shot that arrow,

15:11.270 --> 15:12.270
the old Fu Yixiao

15:12.270 --> 15:13.360
was dead.

15:15.630 --> 15:17.120
You killed her yourself.

15:29.200 --> 15:30.240
You once saved me,

15:31.670 --> 15:33.470
but you also killed me yourself.

15:35.030 --> 15:35.960
From now on,

15:37.360 --> 15:38.600
our debts are settled.

15:38.600 --> 15:40.060
We owe each other nothing.

15:40.550 --> 15:41.550
Next time we meet,

15:43.080 --> 15:44.120
we'll be enemies.

15:59.360 --> 16:00.360
Ning Fei is dead.

16:01.240 --> 16:02.700
Tell Xiao Weiran about it.

16:03.510 --> 16:04.770
Think of it as closure.

16:53.370 --> 16:54.800
I was careless.

16:55.360 --> 16:56.720
I never imagined

16:56.720 --> 16:57.840
you'd choose this moment

16:57.840 --> 16:59.080
to meet Xia Jingshi.

17:00.050 --> 17:01.250
When did you get here?

17:02.000 --> 17:02.600
Looks like

17:03.120 --> 17:04.000
I can't escape

17:04.000 --> 17:05.200
your grasp after all.

17:05.270 --> 17:06.400
What did he do to you?

17:06.750 --> 17:07.750
Did you two fight?

17:09.910 --> 17:10.690
I'm fine.

17:12.200 --> 17:12.960
Answer me.

17:13.589 --> 17:14.790
What happened to you?

17:15.440 --> 17:16.369
I'm really fine.

17:17.220 --> 17:18.210
Don't worry.

17:18.750 --> 17:19.640
I'll tell you

17:20.349 --> 17:21.609
what I need to tell you.

17:25.200 --> 17:27.000
I'm doing this for your own good.

17:27.069 --> 17:27.920
Do you know what would have happened

17:27.920 --> 17:29.260
if the Imperial Guards

17:29.350 --> 17:30.680
had caught you just now?

17:36.610 --> 17:39.720
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

17:40.070 --> 17:43.530
♪ Fold the heaven and earth
to make my wings ♪

17:43.920 --> 17:45.490
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

17:45.270 --> 17:46.250
You know what?

17:46.020 --> 17:49.590
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

17:46.960 --> 17:48.520
I've made up my mind.

17:49.480 --> 17:51.530
Even if it means breaking off
the marriage alliance,

17:51.220 --> 17:54.560
♪ I thought this life
would drift like a solitary sail ♪

17:51.880 --> 17:53.360
I'll rush in to save you.

17:54.910 --> 17:58.030
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

17:56.960 --> 18:00.260
[Wutong Mansion]

18:52.060 --> 18:53.460
Did you have a nightmare?

19:01.530 --> 19:02.800
You're all sweaty.

19:05.720 --> 19:07.450
I'll light the candles for you.

19:08.120 --> 19:08.600
No.

19:11.960 --> 19:12.750
No need.

19:17.030 --> 19:17.940
With the light,

19:18.680 --> 19:19.750
all the monsters and demons

19:19.750 --> 19:20.920
will vanish.

19:22.860 --> 19:25.460
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

19:26.390 --> 19:28.770
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

19:28.970 --> 19:32.210
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

19:32.580 --> 19:35.370
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪

19:35.850 --> 19:38.600
♪ The phoenix going against light ♪

19:39.120 --> 19:41.940
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

19:42.300 --> 19:45.480
♪ As years pass, dust stirs,
stirring deep longing ♪

19:45.890 --> 19:51.970
♪ All I ask is to be together  forever ♪

19:57.680 --> 19:58.680
Why are you here?

20:00.710 --> 20:02.770
I was worried you'd have nightmares.

20:04.960 --> 20:06.030
Aren't you going to ask me

20:06.030 --> 20:07.230
what I dreamed about?

20:08.880 --> 20:09.680
I can guess.

20:12.550 --> 20:14.350
Those dreams aren't scary at all.

20:14.350 --> 20:16.010
I couldn't see colors in them,

20:16.070 --> 20:17.800
so I knew they were just dreams.

20:20.560 --> 20:21.630
I remember...

20:22.270 --> 20:23.110
I had just left

20:23.110 --> 20:24.660
Xia Jingshi's.

20:25.440 --> 20:27.300
You were probably just too tired.

20:29.030 --> 20:30.670
You fell asleep

20:31.060 --> 20:32.920
as soon as you left Xia Jingshi's.

20:33.070 --> 20:34.090
I fell asleep?

20:34.870 --> 20:35.550
Yes.

20:36.790 --> 20:38.520
You really can sleep anywhere.

20:38.590 --> 20:40.680
You actually fell asleep on the street.

20:40.680 --> 20:42.540
It really scared them at the time.

20:42.720 --> 20:44.160
But I told them not to worry.

20:44.160 --> 20:45.280
You must

20:45.640 --> 20:46.840
have been exhausted.

20:47.720 --> 20:48.850
Exactly. Too tired.

20:54.400 --> 20:55.400
It's not dawn yet.

20:55.640 --> 20:56.570
Go back to sleep.

20:57.070 --> 20:58.600
I'll keep watch at the door.

20:58.680 --> 20:59.920
You can rest easy.

21:00.400 --> 21:01.290
I'll keep

21:01.590 --> 21:02.920
these candles burning.

21:03.110 --> 21:04.040
There's no need.

21:04.550 --> 21:05.440
I'm fine now.

21:05.750 --> 21:07.010
You should go rest too.

21:37.910 --> 21:38.870
Feng Suige,

21:40.050 --> 21:40.800
thank you.

22:01.070 --> 22:02.710
Who told you to provoke her?

22:02.880 --> 22:03.960
Those are just common methods

22:03.960 --> 22:04.980
to treat hysteria.

22:04.980 --> 22:05.750
She has a head injury

22:05.750 --> 22:06.750
and a blood clot in her brain.

22:06.750 --> 22:07.590
Any stimulus

22:07.590 --> 22:08.720
or emotional outburst

22:08.720 --> 22:10.000
could cause her clot

22:10.000 --> 22:11.200
to burst like a flood.

22:11.270 --> 22:12.590
She's having nightmares

22:12.590 --> 22:13.640
because she was

22:13.660 --> 22:14.660
overstimulated.

22:14.680 --> 22:15.440
If you want her

22:15.440 --> 22:16.570
to live peacefully,

22:16.720 --> 22:18.320
stay away from all the chaos.

22:20.970 --> 22:29.860
[Wutong Mansion]

22:24.920 --> 22:26.250
Where are you taking me?

22:27.830 --> 22:28.270
What?

22:28.960 --> 22:30.420
You think I would harm you?

22:30.610 --> 22:32.720
What are you up to?

22:33.590 --> 22:34.590
Whatever it is,

22:35.030 --> 22:36.860
it can't be anything bad.

22:37.400 --> 22:38.350
If you don't tell me,

22:38.350 --> 22:39.000
I won't go.

22:39.190 --> 22:43.500
[Wutong Mansion]

22:42.360 --> 22:44.020
The wind picked up last night,

22:44.200 --> 22:46.800
and today the sky's full of dark clouds.

22:47.200 --> 22:48.510
I'm worried it might rain

22:48.510 --> 22:49.880
and ruin the herb fields,

22:49.880 --> 22:51.280
so I want to check on them.

22:51.590 --> 22:53.060
It's a long journey.

22:53.400 --> 22:55.070
I just want someone to talk to.

22:56.930 --> 22:58.930
The dignified First Prince of Susha

22:59.000 --> 23:00.110
actually has the leisure

23:00.110 --> 23:01.570
to farm?

23:03.270 --> 23:04.030
What a coincidence.

23:04.030 --> 23:05.180
I'd like to see it.

23:20.450 --> 23:22.070
What are your plans now?

23:23.160 --> 23:23.920
Plans?

23:25.680 --> 23:27.250
Since you left Xia Jingshi,

23:27.270 --> 23:29.240
you're no longer a female general
of Jinxiu.

23:29.240 --> 23:29.830
And if I were to

23:29.830 --> 23:30.830
make you my concubine,

23:30.830 --> 23:32.630
it would seem far too frivolous.

23:33.030 --> 23:34.560
Have you ever thought about

23:36.880 --> 23:37.540
joining me?

23:39.830 --> 23:40.900
Joining you?

23:41.200 --> 23:42.260
What's in it for me?

23:43.790 --> 23:44.920
What's in it for you?

23:46.830 --> 23:48.400
You'll officially work for me.

23:48.400 --> 23:49.550
Whatever happens from now on,

23:49.550 --> 23:50.580
I'll protect you

23:50.830 --> 23:52.180
and keep you safe.

23:52.750 --> 23:53.590
I know

23:54.510 --> 23:55.910
you're trying to find out

23:55.920 --> 23:57.000
what exactly Xia Jingshi

23:57.000 --> 23:57.640
told me.

23:58.000 --> 23:59.310
You can be straightforward.

23:59.310 --> 24:01.350
There's no need to beat around the bush.

24:01.350 --> 24:02.440
That day in the tent,

24:02.440 --> 24:03.830
the one meeting with Xia Jingshi

24:03.830 --> 24:04.920
was a masked man.

24:05.400 --> 24:07.030
Xia Jingshi called him Meng Junran.

24:07.030 --> 24:08.160
No matter how I pressed him,

24:08.160 --> 24:10.620
Xia Jingshi refused
to reveal his identity.

24:10.750 --> 24:11.790
In the Battle of Pingling,

24:11.790 --> 24:12.810
their plan

24:13.270 --> 24:14.870
was to lure you into the city,

24:14.960 --> 24:16.640
use hundreds of thousands of civilians
as shields,

24:16.640 --> 24:18.580
and wipe out your Feng Battalion.

24:19.240 --> 24:20.700
Use civilians as shields?

24:22.400 --> 24:24.310
If you had broken through Zhennan Pass

24:24.310 --> 24:25.750
and entered Pingling City,

24:25.750 --> 24:27.310
would you have slaughtered the civilians?

24:27.310 --> 24:28.110
Of course not.

24:28.160 --> 24:29.640
What if among the civilians

24:29.640 --> 24:31.310
there were hidden crossbowmen

24:31.310 --> 24:32.620
out to kill you?

24:33.640 --> 24:34.550
When you can't tell the enemy

24:34.550 --> 24:35.760
from the civilians,

24:36.160 --> 24:37.160
what would you do?

24:39.920 --> 24:41.190
I have to kill them all.

24:41.640 --> 24:42.530
In that case,

24:42.880 --> 24:44.240
you'd become the true culprit
behind the massacre

24:44.240 --> 24:46.000
of hundreds of thousands in Pingling City.

24:46.000 --> 24:47.520
Even if you managed to survive

24:47.520 --> 24:48.650
and return to Susha,

24:48.680 --> 24:50.400
your reputation would be ruined.

24:50.400 --> 24:51.350
Everyone would see you

24:51.350 --> 24:52.810
as a bloodthirsty killer.

24:53.350 --> 24:54.680
What a clever scheme.

24:55.550 --> 24:56.350
It seems that

24:56.370 --> 24:57.920
if not for that arrow
you shot at me that day,

24:57.920 --> 24:58.550
I'd have died

24:58.550 --> 24:59.950
without a proper burial.

25:00.830 --> 25:02.890
I guess it was a blessing in disguise.

25:03.000 --> 25:03.600
By the way,

25:04.400 --> 25:06.130
thank you for the gold-threaded soft armor
you gave me—

25:06.130 --> 25:07.060
it saved my life.

25:08.680 --> 25:10.610
But why didn't you use it yourself?

25:10.790 --> 25:13.450
With my martial skills,
I didn't need to wear it.

25:15.510 --> 25:17.240
I know what you're about to say.

25:17.750 --> 25:19.030
That I'm so arrogant,

25:19.120 --> 25:21.120
yet I still ended up defeated by you.

25:22.000 --> 25:23.240
I wasn't thinking that at all.

25:23.240 --> 25:24.070
You said it.

25:26.590 --> 25:28.320
A blessing in disguise, right?

25:42.030 --> 25:43.090
Whose home is this?

25:43.480 --> 25:44.310
Mine.

25:45.480 --> 25:46.030
It's quite similar

25:46.030 --> 25:47.490
to my home in Zhennan Pass.

25:48.000 --> 25:48.780
Looks like

25:48.920 --> 25:51.780
you're not fond of
living in a grand mansion either.

26:53.750 --> 26:55.350
That's my mother's hairpin.

26:59.680 --> 27:00.670
You mean

27:01.070 --> 27:02.720
the former empress of Susha?

27:05.160 --> 27:07.360
This is my mother's private residence.

27:07.680 --> 27:08.970
When she was young,

27:09.160 --> 27:10.960
she often led troops in battles.

27:11.200 --> 27:12.200
Every time she returned from war

27:12.200 --> 27:14.310
and didn't want to go back to the palace,

27:14.310 --> 27:15.160
she would come here

27:15.160 --> 27:16.220
and stay for a while

27:16.510 --> 27:18.370
to escape all those constraints.

27:20.350 --> 27:22.790
I never imagined the former empress
of Susha

27:22.790 --> 27:24.590
was such a free-spirited woman.

27:28.880 --> 27:30.030
My mother always yearned

27:30.030 --> 27:31.690
for a life of freedom and ease.

27:32.070 --> 27:33.800
If it hadn't been for my father,

27:33.920 --> 27:35.070
she would never have trapped herself

27:35.070 --> 27:37.140
within the palace walls.

27:39.590 --> 27:40.270
So...

27:41.070 --> 27:42.400
you once lived here too?

27:43.590 --> 27:44.830
When I was little,

27:44.850 --> 27:46.680
I often stayed here with my mother.

27:46.680 --> 27:48.480
There were no palace rules here—

27:48.480 --> 27:49.680
just freedom and joy.

27:51.110 --> 27:52.920
She would spend her days with us

27:52.920 --> 27:54.080
planting herbs

27:54.270 --> 27:55.730
and tending flowers here.

28:01.190 --> 28:02.920
Sometimes when my father came,

28:03.160 --> 28:04.620
he'd take me and Xiyang

28:04.880 --> 28:06.500
to the stream to catch fish.

28:22.890 --> 28:23.960
Hug it.

28:33.150 --> 28:33.750
Aside from

28:33.750 --> 28:34.920
the four of us,

28:35.920 --> 28:36.640
no one knew

28:36.640 --> 28:38.100
what this place used to be.

28:47.000 --> 28:47.920
Now, there's you.

28:47.800 --> 28:49.780
♪ Love is a trial, harsh and cold ♪

28:50.300 --> 28:53.330
♪ Who crushes the lingering pain for me? ♪

28:53.890 --> 28:59.260
♪ Clouds vanish, rain ceases, seek me ♪

29:02.990 --> 29:06.320
♪ The world is vast and far ♪

29:09.700 --> 29:12.470
♪ Time is unbearable to endure ♪

29:13.020 --> 29:15.950
♪ Lost in the wilderness ♪

29:16.390 --> 29:18.900
♪ I've been looking for you ♪

29:19.410 --> 29:22.100
♪ Even if devastation fills my eyes ♪

29:22.770 --> 29:25.240
♪ The shadows continue to sway ♪

29:25.930 --> 29:28.630
♪ The phoenix going against light ♪

29:29.310 --> 29:31.900
♪ Has been looking for a thousand miles ♪

29:32.440 --> 29:35.400
♪ As years pass, dust stirs,
stirring deep longing ♪

29:36.030 --> 29:40.530
♪ All I ask is to be together  forever ♪

30:05.110 --> 30:06.570
Who's trying to catch you?

30:06.750 --> 30:08.270
Why do they want to kill you?

30:08.270 --> 30:08.960
You already know the answers

30:08.960 --> 30:10.290
to these two questions.

30:11.480 --> 30:13.550
According to our previous agreement,

30:13.550 --> 30:14.310
our cooperation

30:14.310 --> 30:15.240
ends here.

30:17.880 --> 30:18.610
I said before

30:19.240 --> 30:20.640
that if you want to leave,

30:21.160 --> 30:22.560
I won't force you to stay.

30:25.590 --> 30:26.650
You brought me here

30:27.240 --> 30:28.480
just to tell me this?

30:30.310 --> 30:30.830
Yes.

30:38.920 --> 30:39.850
But not exactly.

30:40.310 --> 30:41.290
Then what is it?

30:41.720 --> 30:42.640
Stop beating around the bush.

30:42.640 --> 30:43.480
Just say it.

30:46.370 --> 30:46.960
Whatever

30:46.960 --> 30:48.280
Xia Jingshi's plan is,

30:49.070 --> 30:50.810
it only targets Susha

30:50.840 --> 30:51.640
and me.

30:52.030 --> 30:53.630
It has nothing to do with you.

30:54.270 --> 30:55.330
If you're willing,

30:55.960 --> 30:57.000
I can find you

30:57.030 --> 30:59.360
a place with beautiful scenery to live in.

30:59.470 --> 31:01.730
You can take those children with you too.

31:02.960 --> 31:04.830
So you don't want me to help you find

31:04.830 --> 31:06.070
that masked man?

31:08.480 --> 31:09.480
Even without you,

31:10.770 --> 31:12.190
I can find him on my own.

31:23.880 --> 31:24.540
Feng Suige,

31:25.550 --> 31:26.530
you seem

31:26.880 --> 31:28.620
rather unfamiliar today.

31:28.920 --> 31:30.380
Your sudden concern for me

31:30.790 --> 31:32.010
makes me a bit scared.

31:33.240 --> 31:34.240
What are you up to?

31:35.640 --> 31:36.660
What purpose can I have?

31:36.660 --> 31:38.000
Whatever your purpose,

31:38.330 --> 31:40.590
you clearly don't have good intentions.

31:43.350 --> 31:44.220
Feng Suige,

31:45.270 --> 31:45.830
since the day

31:45.830 --> 31:46.920
you arrested me,

31:46.920 --> 31:48.180
I've wanted to tell you

31:50.120 --> 31:52.220
that even though you hold every advantage

31:52.220 --> 31:53.550
and seem certain to win,

31:54.270 --> 31:55.270
you will never

31:55.270 --> 31:56.160
beat me.

31:57.790 --> 31:58.560
Why?

32:15.680 --> 32:17.110
Because I always know

32:18.030 --> 32:19.350
what you're thinking.

32:33.270 --> 32:34.930
There's quite a big fish here.

33:05.090 --> 33:08.120
♪ Take down the setting sun as my heart ♪

33:08.550 --> 33:12.060
♪ Fold the heaven and earth
to make my wings ♪

33:12.570 --> 33:13.980
♪ If fate shows no mercy ♪

33:14.340 --> 33:17.700
♪ Then don't blame my recklessness ♪

33:19.830 --> 33:23.040
♪ I thought this life
would drift like a solitary sail ♪

33:23.440 --> 33:26.560
♪ Yet I chanced upon you
in the smoke-filled alleyway ♪

33:27.120 --> 33:30.070
♪ Like a fleeting flower falling into ♪

33:28.000 --> 33:29.210
She's having nightmares

33:29.210 --> 33:29.880
because she was

33:29.880 --> 33:31.370
overstimulated.

33:30.480 --> 33:32.780
♪ My eyes ♪

33:31.400 --> 33:32.240
If you want her

33:32.240 --> 33:33.390
to live peacefully,

33:33.420 --> 33:35.160
stay away from all the chaos.

33:33.510 --> 33:34.930
♪ Once I was like a frost-edged sword ♪

33:35.390 --> 33:37.120
♪ Sweeping across the battlefield
in gleaming light ♪

33:38.160 --> 33:40.450
♪ Never thought who'd lay me to rest ♪

33:40.830 --> 33:42.250
♪ Once unstoppable and sharp ♪

33:42.750 --> 33:44.460
♪ Now my heart's tied to you ♪

33:45.790 --> 33:47.820
♪ Thinking of you day and night ♪

34:37.190 --> 34:38.050
Your Highness.

34:38.360 --> 34:39.420
We found Xun Xiang.

34:39.510 --> 34:40.710
Lu Ke is watching him.

34:42.020 --> 34:42.679
I see.

34:43.920 --> 34:44.710
When she wakes,

34:44.710 --> 34:45.850
escort her back to the residence.

34:45.850 --> 34:47.110
Be extremely careful.

34:47.590 --> 34:47.960
Yes.

35:43.520 --> 35:45.390
When you planned to kill,

35:45.470 --> 35:47.670
did you ever think about your daughter?

35:53.190 --> 35:55.000
Do you plan to surrender,

35:55.110 --> 35:56.360
or should I have your whole family
arrested

35:56.360 --> 35:58.490
to keep you company?

36:01.510 --> 36:02.200
Get in!

36:06.480 --> 36:07.340
Your Highness,

36:07.510 --> 36:09.070
the Xun family
is distantly related to the Empress.

36:09.070 --> 36:09.960
Aren't we being

36:10.000 --> 36:11.190
a bit too conspicuous?

36:11.190 --> 36:13.100
Fu Yixiao is under my protection.

36:13.510 --> 36:14.840
I want everyone in Yujing City

36:14.840 --> 36:16.400
to know about this.

36:16.400 --> 36:17.860
Whoever dares to harm her,

36:18.670 --> 36:19.670
I will kill them.

36:36.070 --> 36:37.200
Your Majesty, I came

36:37.480 --> 36:39.360
to report something important.

36:41.760 --> 36:42.920
Recently, someone actually

36:42.920 --> 36:45.400
attempted to assassinate
a member of my household.

36:45.400 --> 36:47.030
We've caught the culprit.

36:47.480 --> 36:48.740
He's outside the hall.

36:51.230 --> 36:52.190
Are the Ministry of Justice

36:52.190 --> 36:53.960
and the Court of Judicial Review
both closed?

36:53.960 --> 36:54.920
If someone tries to assassinate you,

36:54.920 --> 36:56.070
just go to them.

36:56.670 --> 36:58.930
What do you mean by bringing the assassin

36:59.280 --> 37:00.210
into the palace?

37:00.320 --> 37:02.440
It's because this person
has a special identity.

37:02.440 --> 37:04.000
I have no authority to handle him.

37:04.000 --> 37:06.000
I request Your Majesty's judgment.

37:06.360 --> 37:06.920
Lu Ke.

37:13.000 --> 37:13.480
Kneel!

37:16.000 --> 37:17.110
Your Majesty, spare me!

37:17.110 --> 37:18.440
Your Majesty, spare me!

37:20.650 --> 37:22.710
Is this the child from the Xun family?

37:23.030 --> 37:23.630
Yes.

37:24.440 --> 37:25.920
Your Majesty, you remember

37:25.920 --> 37:26.920
the Empress's relatives

37:26.920 --> 37:28.070
very well.

37:30.040 --> 37:31.660
Are you saying

37:31.920 --> 37:34.320
that this person's
assassination attempt at your residence

37:34.320 --> 37:35.920
is connected to the Empress?

37:36.440 --> 37:37.970
Your Majesty, you are wise.

37:38.440 --> 37:40.060
The truth and justice

37:40.150 --> 37:41.950
rest entirely on your judgment.

37:42.150 --> 37:44.150
I'm afraid the Empress already knows

37:44.150 --> 37:45.190
that I brought Xun Xiang

37:45.190 --> 37:46.120
into the palace.

37:47.070 --> 37:48.320
As for how deeply

37:48.320 --> 37:49.550
she is involved,

37:50.280 --> 37:51.320
Your Majesty,

37:51.550 --> 37:52.680
please wait and see.

37:53.710 --> 37:56.320
You seem quite confident.

38:15.510 --> 38:16.980
Greetings, Your Majesty.

38:18.710 --> 38:19.510
Your Majesty.

38:21.710 --> 38:22.550
First Prince,

38:23.280 --> 38:24.800
you brought someone covered in blood

38:24.800 --> 38:25.960
before His Majesty.

38:26.120 --> 38:27.590
If it startled His Majesty,

38:27.590 --> 38:29.450
what punishment would befit you?

38:30.640 --> 38:32.360
His Majesty is a warrior emperor

38:32.360 --> 38:33.280
who has expanded our territories

38:33.280 --> 38:34.880
and achieved unparalleled merit.

38:34.880 --> 38:36.740
He will not be startled so easily.

38:37.320 --> 38:38.290
Empress,

38:39.150 --> 38:40.230
why are you here?

38:40.550 --> 38:41.590
I heard today that

38:41.590 --> 38:43.960
the First Prince
entered the palace unexpectedly

38:43.960 --> 38:45.780
and feared he might displease you again.

38:45.780 --> 38:47.320
His Majesty didn't sleep well last night

38:47.320 --> 38:49.050
and woke up dizzy this morning.

38:49.670 --> 38:50.510
First Prince,

38:50.800 --> 38:52.670
please speak to His Majesty patiently.

38:52.670 --> 38:54.270
Don't upset him.

38:55.190 --> 38:56.030
Your Majesty,

38:56.030 --> 38:57.800
I truly admire

38:58.030 --> 38:59.690
your concern for His Majesty.

39:00.230 --> 39:01.320
However,

39:01.320 --> 39:02.250
you may not know,

39:03.000 --> 39:04.380
but General Xun

39:05.190 --> 39:07.190
has already confessed everything.

39:22.480 --> 39:23.630
I don't understand

39:23.630 --> 39:24.850
what First Prince is saying.

39:24.850 --> 39:26.800
But if I weren't here today,

39:27.230 --> 39:28.270
some matters

39:28.400 --> 39:30.600
might have been impossible to clarify.

39:31.230 --> 39:34.150
Our Zhuang family and the Xun family
are only distant relatives,

39:34.150 --> 39:35.810
with very little connection.

39:35.880 --> 39:37.330
I don't know

39:37.360 --> 39:38.510
how Xun Xiang offended

39:38.510 --> 39:39.840
the First Prince today.

39:40.440 --> 39:42.350
But no matter what the Xun family
has done,

39:42.350 --> 39:43.870
I am unaware.

39:44.320 --> 39:45.800
How this matter should be handled

39:45.800 --> 39:47.590
is for Your Majesty to decide.

39:48.150 --> 39:50.210
Although I'm not welcomed in Yujing,

39:50.480 --> 39:52.360
everything should follow the principle

39:52.360 --> 39:54.150
of fair rewards and punishments.

39:54.150 --> 39:55.280
Otherwise, how can I continue

39:55.280 --> 39:56.530
living here?

39:57.190 --> 39:58.060
First Prince,

39:58.960 --> 39:59.900
when has His Majesty ever let you

39:59.900 --> 40:01.230
suffer any injustice?

40:01.590 --> 40:03.050
-Isn't this...
-Empress.

40:03.710 --> 40:05.160
This is not the harem.

40:05.640 --> 40:06.900
I'll talk to you

40:07.030 --> 40:08.630
when I get back.

40:08.960 --> 40:09.970
You may leave now.

40:19.290 --> 40:20.520
Yes, Your Majesty.

40:32.710 --> 40:34.320
I know you suspect the Empress

40:34.320 --> 40:35.450
of involvement,

40:35.760 --> 40:37.700
but you have no solid evidence.

40:38.630 --> 40:40.570
Didn't he say nothing at all?

40:40.840 --> 40:42.390
Does it matter

40:42.560 --> 40:43.760
whether he did or not?

40:46.000 --> 40:47.260
I am truly innocent...

40:50.360 --> 40:52.440
Xiyang is about to be married.

40:52.670 --> 40:54.730
This is the biggest matter right now.

40:55.110 --> 40:57.150
You have been close to her
since childhood.

40:57.150 --> 40:59.140
Before her wedding,

40:59.840 --> 41:01.640
you cannot let the Jinxiu people

41:01.920 --> 41:04.440
see our royal family as divided.

41:04.880 --> 41:06.400
Your Majesty,
since you said you will not pursue it,

41:06.400 --> 41:07.680
then we will not.

41:08.150 --> 41:09.440
But in the future,

41:09.480 --> 41:11.110
if I act against anyone
around the Empress,

41:11.110 --> 41:13.160
I ask that you treat it the same way.

41:13.320 --> 41:14.050
How dare you!

41:15.110 --> 41:17.180
She is your mother after all!

41:17.400 --> 41:19.540
She has never been my mother.

41:21.920 --> 41:24.070
For the sake
of a mere Jinxiu prisoner of war,

41:24.070 --> 41:25.110
you're deliberately

41:25.110 --> 41:26.300
opposing me today.

41:26.960 --> 41:28.750
No matter how lawless you are,

41:28.920 --> 41:30.890
there are limits.

41:31.360 --> 41:32.980
After all, Susha

41:33.710 --> 41:35.860
is still ruled by me.

41:36.070 --> 41:37.860
Of course you're the ruler.

41:38.000 --> 41:39.230
Wasn't it also you back then

41:39.230 --> 41:40.630
who tacitly allowed them

41:41.070 --> 41:43.720
to murder my mother?

41:48.960 --> 41:49.760
Your Majesty!

41:54.760 --> 41:55.360
Your Majesty!

41:55.360 --> 41:56.400
Please don't be angry.

41:56.400 --> 41:57.440
-Your health is more important.
-Your Highness.

41:57.440 --> 41:59.150
Your Highness, kneel, please.

41:59.150 --> 41:59.860
I'm begging you,

41:59.860 --> 42:01.330
please kneel now!

42:07.470 --> 42:09.590
I issued a strict order long ago

42:10.670 --> 42:11.630
forbidding anyone

42:11.630 --> 42:14.270
from mentioning the late Empress.

42:15.190 --> 42:17.070
How dare you defy my decree?

42:17.120 --> 42:18.540
Why forbid it?

42:19.870 --> 42:22.940
Could it be that you feel guilty?

42:23.760 --> 42:24.690
What did you say?

42:25.160 --> 42:27.350
Do you really want me to repeat it?

42:28.910 --> 42:30.640
Convey my imperial order:

42:31.110 --> 42:32.880
The First Prince has committed
great insubordination

42:32.880 --> 42:34.140
and defied his elders.

42:34.480 --> 42:36.150
He is to return to his residence
and reflect on his conduct.

42:36.150 --> 42:39.320
Before Xiyang's wedding,
the ancestral offering ceremony

42:39.320 --> 42:42.770
will be performed instead
by the Second Prince, Chengyang.

42:49.070 --> 42:49.930
Your Highness!

42:59.760 --> 43:01.360
I shall take my leave as well.

43:01.590 --> 43:02.000
Let's go.
